1380" lrx="976" lry="1420" /><zone xml:id="m-51133bf3-9a9d-4037-8a76-06bdb46f2bf8" ulx="109" uly="1384" lrx="536" lry="1419" /><zone xml:id="m-bfe28651-a0ba-4fef-8608-2915fb2bb553" ulx="551" uly="1411" lrx="976" lry="1443" /><zone xml:id="m-d4901900-19dc-4005-9eb5-b2c4dee845a1" ulx="109" uly="1412" lrx="378" lry="1442" /><zone xml:id="m-16177b2b-9916-4ece-978e-4983dfb87a20" ulx="133" uly="1435" lrx="537" lry="1470" /><zone xml:id="m-c3139b00-1472-416c-a533-36a63794c29b" ulx="575" uly="1437" lrx="978" lry="1472" /><zone xml:id="m-04111fda-2ee5-4d59-b97f-e67163636df1" ulx="552" uly="1463" lrx="976" lry="1501" /><zone xml:id="m-7aae2c79-6338-4bdf-8f0b-1a77f8042dc7" ulx="110" uly="1465" lrx="537" lry="1499" /><zone xml:id="m-efa9bb8e-f5ca-4405-b322-cb356c18cbf0" ulx="112" uly="1492" lrx="449" lry="1530" /><zone xml:id="m-ef285904-7f52-480a-bc97-fa49ebd04df4" ulx="549" uly="1495" lrx="704" lry="1532" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-44ceaae1-e94f-468c-8667-f55c2c4435ba" n="0338" facs="#m-6b7f4056-7bd9-4960-ac38-75ac067b3c59" /><div xml:id="m-8fad1905-6d81-4a26-86d3-dc0e69d9f330">
            <lg xml:id="m-43f68062-7f4a-4e02-99e3-de0f6cb0b0eb">
              <l xml:id="m-2ee380ab-6c75-45f7-bff1-d8425d28fadc" facs="#m-bddc5e00-341d-4b3c-b516-21a064338b01" label="ambiguous">226</l><l xml:id="m-3a1b6a1f-3221-4643-b2a7-9b0584e22826" facs="#m-7c5745ce-37e6-483b-91a2-bcb5e07445ae" label="text-like">Sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-0f182a17-73a5-4040-872e-ca38e2abe4a0" facs="#m-c7442d46-c898-47e8-bd91-d9cf54011a1f" label="ambiguous">HI.</l><l xml:id="m-25f30e82-8905-4a42-a7d1-f00d115b2291" facs="#m-fec70bfb-efcf-4eb2-bbe7-76f38e2eb5f8" label="text-like">T From Septuagesima to Palm Sunday inclusive, instead of Ps. 117. Con¬</l><l xml:id="m-a99e9565-11b8-4569-9368-f08756076ca6" facs="#m-d60f25ac-4713-46c6-aa5f-3c3cf81f047b" label="lyrics-like">sitémini. the following two Psalms are said:</l><l xml:id="m-562ad093-5c11-4850-a37c-08367e0fa0c2" facs="#m-5a4da26f-9f56-4873-9f0c-3e0c87f4978d" label="ambiguous">Psalm 92.</l><l xml:id="m-9e094e34-4715-4cdf-9eaa-aa2e2972ff41" facs="#m-0e2e4d71-6812-4b44-8552-0f8afaf33626" label="ambiguous">Psalm 99</l><l xml:id="m-d64b8ced-51d9-40bf-a871-4c8d8ec58884" facs="#m-b9437524-69e0-421f-adff-adc85d168d1e" label="lyrics-like">Ominus regnávit, decórem in¬</l><l xml:id="m-56f88861-dc37-4c6c-9dd2-1bb61fa60aa7" facs="#m-fbe78e05-aa22-4d32-9abe-2121b0ed6408" label="lyrics-like">IUbiláte Déo ómnis térra : * ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-67e4311f-bac2-41ce-bc15-c4ecd1d6e75c" facs="#m-2b7006d9-995c-4b88-8534-32991322406e" label="lyrics-like">Cl vite Dómino in lactitia.</l><l xml:id="m-86ad24f1-0899-4258-95fb-5e2aa40e7887" facs="#m-86f8e071-0eea-4a0d-8e2b-94463d807a12" label="lyrics-like">U dútus est :* indútus est Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9160137b-797c-4571-ab96-ee38f7eb8f54" facs="#m-ad49abf3-a700-4d48-abad-9410bcff37e8" label="lyrics-like">Introite in conspéctu éjus,</l><l xml:id="m-7e985bca-5c14-480b-8221-6a9dbbf93658" facs="#m-93430796-6b3a-4a22-a6a3-b2121093c473" label="lyrics-like">nus fortitúdinem, et praecinxit se.</l><l xml:id="m-98acd4bb-9217-4123-a247-7ef6a22009ed" facs="#m-77b2e3d7-eb7d-40da-aa2c-79b8964716e3" label="lyrics-like">Etenim firmávit órbem terrae,»</l><l xml:id="m-7d3cef63-3fff-4177-98ee-14b755e94bfe" facs="#m-19d0b901-baf6-4b15-bdb2-3323e47ab17e" label="lyrics-like">exsultatióne.</l><l xml:id="m-2be9ed38-4f6f-4e60-a384-44b492783eda" facs="#m-f2dcbefa-fdde-403e-b5ba-456ae5f2cd87" label="lyrics-like">Scitóte quóniam Dóminus ipse</l><l xml:id="m-1927d35e-cd88-4d44-9e6f-1a274b0f8139" facs="#m-506d1173-9bf3-415e-9fa3-b968c565b1f0" label="lyrics-like">qui non commovébitur.</l><l xml:id="m-557ea861-e006-4b9f-b40f-73defb92c6fd" facs="#m-af817666-633c-49a2-91dd-295c89897eb7" label="lyrics-like">Paráta sédes túa ex tunc :* a</l><l xml:id="m-5999f95f-294b-4eea-9c6b-2a6134e27868" facs="#m-6da7dd89-a593-4c70-adb5-ab7dabb74abc" label="lyrics-like">est Déus :* Ipse fécit nos, et non</l><l xml:id="m-fe9f2846-56b6-4051-aed1-8063293d0c4e" facs="#m-12f0d04a-c9f7-4e94-a204-b32482685237" label="lyrics-like">saéculo tú es.</l><l xml:id="m-5464f202-e506-432e-8dfe-3c8378175a4d" facs="#m-02eaff5c-dbdf-4262-8612-6e8b399c772e" label="ambiguous">ipsi nos.</l><l xml:id="m-91f43150-17a7-4f1b-a07a-b96af2fcd737" facs="#m-f10e28d6-01e3-4b4d-8a15-bed4eac1dc0f" label="lyrics-like">Elevavérunt flúmina, Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-fdbf8efc-adbf-4217-8990-45b48b073864" facs="#m-f79b2a68-d86f-4eb7-887f-abe9b38717b6" label="lyrics-like">Pópulus éjus, et óves páscuae</l><l xml:id="m-29942d20-b278-461b-836a-42a29074a55a" facs="#m-fc045540-7c0c-44af-8f4d-1c0b7d15231e" label="lyrics-like">éjus : t introite pórtas éjus in con¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b7039be-fcbc-41f5-b7c8-c0d6bc62304e" facs="#m-d54f6775-cb14-43a7-b66a-8bc3a15bcf47" label="lyrics-like">elevavérunt flúmina vócem súam.</l><l xml:id="m-04dc678c-a5cf-4d60-87ea-99e0b5863a23" facs="#m-3ad88695-e646-4c59-bf88-8f059e754aec" label="lyrics-like">Elevavérunt flúmina fúctus</l><l xml:id="m-cb111b45-1564-4e28-9afe-84f0fb5d28b4" facs="#m-6415ccd3-5702-4d5e-8775-24289d5dbbb9" label="lyrics-like">fessióne, * átria éjus in hymnis:</l><l xml:id="m-c6d1fdfc-1962-43ee-9f04-114ee26bb7d2" facs="#m-14738e7f-4c2b-41cf-9ce2-7675284c698d" label="lyrics-like">súos, * a vócibus aquárum multá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a7595706-0ce5-486e-bf53-0c046740f7b5" facs="#m-8d3c3fa1-b3b0-4c6c-8867-9f665a31c4ad" label="lyrics-like">confitémini illi.</l><l xml:id="m-fc4ad933-a50c-4cf5-99b5-746019548d50" facs="#m-026c1b2e-40a1-4585-98a5-1a7474779a9e" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte nómen éjus: quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-1184bd38-5f88-4836-9196-a2e6d50f43a1" facs="#m-3a89dcf2-9948-40d6-b151-a7732abf94ca" label="ambiguous">rum.</l><l xml:id="m-8f3fe81a-6174-4ce3-aaf8-2a54c4588ae3" facs="#m-edf3f30e-fbc3-4601-a0c4-70f10e308e90" label="lyrics-like">Mirábiles elatiónes máris: * mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d28246d3-4503-4c8a-a99f-852c6838b1aa" facs="#m-85eced83-c51e-48aa-8d6f-1fcc3caf9eac" label="lyrics-like">suávis est Dóminus, tin aetérnummi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8c280d8-f58d-4023-a81d-d47d67f0ff96" facs="#m-a773befc-da07-4a65-80a4-61151e60fef2" label="lyrics-like">rábilis in áltis Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-fe010a6f-e158-4558-bd73-ade33e92feea" facs="#m-3f4f0d5d-b353-4955-a2c8-2097a5215310" label="lyrics-like">sericórdia ejus, xet usque ingenera¬</l><l xml:id="m-9e1192cf-7230-40bf-b79b-2ff84718e264" facs="#m-4787843a-c9d6-4cf3-bdaa-56974bed8ce6" label="lyrics-like">Testimónia túa credibilia fácta</l><l xml:id="m-c36d3b1d-40f5-4c56-a13d-dea6375c2fe8" facs="#m-02dc8f28-4f76-484c-9739-180b5eddbd4b" label="lyrics-like">tiónem et generatiónem véritaséjus.</l><l xml:id="m-d2427a5c-aee0-4c65-b259-607c8b2b2a15" facs="#m-56ac35e8-a61d-42d9-81f0-6b08295291d9" label="lyrics-like">sunt nimis :* dómum túam décet</l><l xml:id="m-5a82d280-29ed-4584-bd59-870afeada37d" facs="#m-e8e94be3-e31b-44eb-ba00-9984bee27263" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 118. Beáti immaculáti. as</l><l xml:id="m-83b2a2e2-76b2-4df6-8eba-f8f1115b3551" facs="#m-3a006b91-e862-4244-a9e2-683bee9af6e6" label="lyrics-like">sanctitúdo, Dómine, in longitúdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-666fb58e-de8d-4fec-b354-12853bca905b" facs="#m-ff796034-b390-40a5-81f3-7aedc54a5882" label="ambiguous">Ibelow.</l><l xml:id="m-759c93cb-acda-4ab7-ab5f-bf20e494554a" facs="#m-4b1b3759-1ee8-4171-9fff-64635cb4d0e5" label="lyrics-like">nem diérum.</l><l xml:id="m-a3dc14bc-df5b-4fbb-81c3-998ba7cc0f91" facs="#m-04b79d6b-f411-4d84-9570-9c1f32d1cf01" label="ambiguous">II.</l><l xml:id="m-1e2707c8-7031-41b2-a021-41ce90d85d54" facs="#m-4779c958-4243-4cc0-907d-a2241effed73" label="text-like">T On Privileged Vigils, and on all Feasts of which the Office mar be</l><l xml:id="m-e9d9e351-2d10-449c-80f6-2883dc1d0b1c" facs="#m-0b0b959a-b6c3-4290-a233-dd9c2219f8fe" label="text-like">celebrated on Sunday, no matter on what day the Feast itself should fall,</l><l xml:id="m-5ec61130-a8bb-4813-802c-da4aeb512e63" facs="#m-39ac1cf1-a9c3-4ba8-8106-2823b8ada8bc" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 53. Déus in nómine túo. is said as below instead of Ps. 117. Then follows</l><l xml:id="m-23079863-2f45-45cb-9739-9fbb026a0d7d" facs="#m-b7a5a721-719d-4fbe-a025-f7e7ce21295f" label="lyrics-like">the Ps. 118. Beáti immaculáti.</l><l xml:id="m-f1e1c4ce-4828-4863-ab63-a1e106283ab7" facs="#m-cca7d08f-2341-4193-971b-11e416657f83" label="ambiguous">Psalm II8. I.</l><l xml:id="m-40d7658a-78ee-4362-80b1-8c7c77147f91" facs="#m-7d5100f7-0361-472b-88fc-2634c1dac0a6" label="ambiguous">Psalm 53.</l><l xml:id="m-c02790e7-a6ad-48e8-ace6-f3586efb342e" facs="#m-8e5d90ff-1d99-4a6c-99ca-dbb3ec6742ca" label="lyrics-like">DEáti immaculáti in via :* qui</l><l xml:id="m-58e19a8a-309c-4439-b314-7563ff6c7554" facs="#m-a5f93cd4-7801-4b04-8ad8-66f1f456ccfe" label="lyrics-like">Eus in nómine túo sálvum mé</l><l xml:id="m-2efafc43-b017-49fd-90a0-95d62385daa8" facs="#m-2b16ab91-8c16-4093-b03a-aa1c73ef26e9" label="lyrics-like">D fac :* et in virtúte túa Judiea</l><l xml:id="m-0cccdba9-72ee-4628-b376-2a9179329148" facs="#m-30c2dbbe-9bd0-4b83-a417-e2931109745e" label="lyrics-like">D ámbulant in lége Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-88ab19f0-e9a7-432a-88ed-7843ab9b9bc6" facs="#m-69a9dbc9-2a4a-4401-b072-483133650eed" label="lyrics-like">Beáti qui scrutántur testimónia</l><l xml:id="m-50d2a656-f52b-4174-96f7-36bd0913080c" facs="#m-c7da2393-0908-49de-96c0-722a7d48dc34" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-c391e94e-9f2b-4403-a8c1-6f9e035c3db5" facs="#m-f515b118-ac05-42bc-b22b-ef8fcaef5abd" label="lyrics-like">Déus exáudi oratiónem méam:*</l><l xml:id="m-c3e0333a-bc83-417d-bdc8-eb17d04bd0f1" facs="#m-8aa2dd30-1d9d-412c-9118-c69d4dbce6bf" label="lyrics-like">eius:* in tóto córde exquirunt éum.</l><l xml:id="m-fca3f092-fbe5-43c9-8408-282fec3b66b7" facs="#m-9e851bcd-9add-4f2c-973b-cd3fb6140cf8" label="lyrics-like">Non enim qui operántur iniqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-5184c5ca-257f-47e7-8ade-67a3680ed5e4" facs="#m-2fc18286-5576-4080-b016-b67ee1d5c80d" label="lyrics-like">áuribus pércipe vérba óris méi.</l><l xml:id="m-4e12930a-dae6-4f05-bd66-43b57e98da88" facs="#m-e12a6e21-5629-4c8a-bfb0-5e4269ee4c90" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam aliéni insurrexérunt ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-425bb6bd-e777-4407-a49f-26a2b04581a8" facs="#m-73a1f3a6-119b-4803-8d87-32a93b8efa26" label="lyrics-like">tátem, * in viis éjus ambulavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a286373-42c4-44f5-8b71-785cd77f5299" facs="#m-eb16ee42-f89f-4f53-96e0-4306886f6178" label="lyrics-like">vérsum me, t et fórtes quaesiérunt</l><l xml:id="m-58c54d7e-20b2-4a6e-8f87-a5fc170d802a" facs="#m-775b984d-1af7-4524-9866-9fa84f70048c" label="ambiguous">runt.</l><l xml:id="m-e4cde5ef-8437-474c-9fb6-97fde828a645" facs="#m-aa0748cb-e32f-4ddb-91b8-b680f3f367e2" label="lyrics-like">Tú mandásti * mandáta túa cu¬</l><l xml:id="m-db28ce62-36fd-432f-96b0-da05b668fff5" facs="#m-7f28f3ef-3883-4dff-9bf0-619c20e868bb" label="lyrics-like">ánimam méam: * et non propo¬</l><l xml:id="m-48753bac-bd5e-4c2f-904b-0a1d3bd2367e" facs="#m-bd74c7ea-f88e-4388-b19e-470be1e7d338" label="lyrics-like">suérunt Déum ante conspéctum</l><l xml:id="m-d1789ba3-ac87-4e89-9695-6537ca2177a6" facs="#m-688505f0-9697-42ac-afb8-449d980df9e2" label="ambiguous">stodiri nimis.</l><l xml:id="m-fc0889e2-f7fc-46f5-988b-f47157a16bf3" facs="#m-d1a84445-c42e-48f4-bd21-beb39d758cfc" label="lyrics-like">súum.</l><l xml:id="m-26e291ab-b4a8-44e9-9041-f75b96e509d2" facs="#m-7c178073-c162-493d-a95b-ca82446b10f1" label="lyrics-like">Utinam dirigántur víae méae,</l><l xml:id="m-b8a97a7e-0558-4042-865d-00518b0ebab5" facs="#m-e5526656-d2cc-4663-bae1-f1330e398805" label="lyrics-like">Ecce enim Déus ádjuvat me:</l><l xml:id="m-8c4d1dbe-39cd-405a-9683-d406b475c996" facs="#m-4e48a216-3df6-4034-99a0-a131f3cf238b" label="lyrics-like">ad custodiéndas justificatiónes túas!</l><l xml:id="m-c888fee4-5176-4c59-b14a-568e79ac63fe" facs="#m-5b653c9d-7505-408f-af0c-532ebe7e7dac" label="lyrics-like">et Dóminus suscéptor est ánimae</l><l xml:id="m-e684b4dd-cf0d-43a8-81d2-22c3c1b38738" facs="#m-9e788fa7-6f1a-4826-9ddf-4a0dc8439ce9" label="ambiguous">Tunc non confundar, * cum per¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9297478-eb86-4647-877c-c7d1ecb1a1b7" facs="#m-75445354-619b-44c4-996a-22857fe36bbb" label="lyrics-like">méae.</l><l xml:id="m-9806fc95-6ec8-4ac1-824c-6fbb338b1fea" facs="#m-64f73cbc-d33e-4386-b4f5-79cc7e7827fa" label="lyrics-like">spéxero in ómnibus mandátis túis.</l><l xml:id="m-9cb01c27-c9d9-4bc0-9630-a7864fedf9bc" facs="#m-9bd726eb-0ab8-4e7e-a9a2-2630fa584198" label="lyrics-like">Avérte mála inimicis méis: *et</l><l xml:id="m-4a4adf71-252e-418a-abb9-a4a1f7cb8c8b" facs="#m-b63c3353-5335-4758-aaf2-c35b11d58549" label="lyrics-like">Confitébor tibi in directióne cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-196601e8-6a2a-44ae-90c1-05d76e3d9dfb" facs="#m-3770d517-1284-41f7-b997-4686852077ae" label="lyrics-like">in veritáte túa dispérde illos.</l><l xml:id="m-50f3e027-4517-4760-9cdb-1f1e30bb5ee4" facs="#m-e0148fc6-4493-40f2-ac62-d019cfed4fa9" label="lyrics-like">dis :* in éo quod didici judicia ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-360f3ffe-a9d5-42fd-95e9-153664bd405b" facs="#m-a7cd9bb5-8523-4599-a6fc-130ded17f559" label="lyrics-like">Voluntárie sacrificãbo tibi, * et</l><l xml:id="m-7f0c0d7d-584e-4a00-9728-11fcf5c0b27b" facs="#m-07816cc1-e689-4511-abf7-5deb721eb62d" label="lyrics-like">stitiae túae.</l><l xml:id="m-fd773d32-7296-474e-b0c4-ddad098f810e" facs="#m-f0f815f0-0f84-411d-9e65-b38ebae4db3d" label="lyrics-like">Justificatiónes túas custódiam :"</l><l xml:id="m-4886644d-6545-47a1-8f8e-e8dc1af87eda" facs="#m-51133bf3-9a9d-4037-8a76-06bdb46f2bf8" label="lyrics-like">confitébor nómini túo Dómine:</l><l xml:id="m-1b1fc3f2-30fd-4017-8974-b8090b20641d" facs="#m-bfe28651-a0ba-4fef-8608-2915fb2bb553" label="lyrics-like">non me derelínquas usquequáque.</l><l xml:id="m-1841f281-9fa7-40e9-a334-36ab94fc04aa" facs="#m-d4901900-19dc-4005-9eb5-b2c4dee845a1" label="lyrics-like">quóniam bónum est :</l><l xml:id="m-2d8fe277-ba64-463c-bdf5-95cabf4ee35f" facs="#m-16177b2b-9916-4ece-978e-4983dfb87a20" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam ex ómni tribulatióne</l><l xml:id="m-33ad7961-72f9-4f85-a6c5-22bd4e22ab63" facs="#m-c3139b00-1472-416c-a533-36a63794c29b" label="lyrics-like">In quo córrigit adolescéntior</l><l xml:id="m-15b04ba8-33ae-425b-a0b9-3dabd7e5cc57" facs="#m-04111fda-2ee5-4d59-b97f-e67163636df1" label="lyrics-like">viam súam? * in custodiéndo ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-a27f0c02-b0b5-4078-8e76-9588d20cb56d" facs="#m-7aae2c79-6338-4bdf-8f0b-1a77f8042dc7" label="ambiguous">eripuisti me:* et super inimicos</l><l xml:id="m-8d5f8a3e-9075-4ee2-9790-2c95480c912e" facs="#m-efa9bb8e-f5ca-4405-b322-cb356c18cbf0" label="lyrics-like">méos despéxit óculus méus.</l><l xml:id="m-1b6a6f65-3232-4314-a827-a7d490193277" facs="#m-ef285904-7f52-480a-bc97-fa49ebd04df4" label="lyrics-like">mónes túos.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
